Dan:<i> It's sucking all
 the smoke and fire out.</i>

00:07:40.626 --> 00:07:43.929
Gav:<i> Like a tabletop nuke.</i>

00:07:43.962 --> 00:07:45.965
Dan:<i> Not what you wanna see
 on a barbecue, really.</i>

